Two giant serpents live in a cavern deep below [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], in a wild cave where purple crystals on the ceiling cast a bluish glow and small creatures live in the pools. They speak, and they keep watch on whoever enters their cavern.

When the Party came upon them they rose half out of the water and demanded to know who they were and whether they were allowed to be there. They asked to see a permission slip and moved to eat it before Benny pulled it back. They said they did not know the Party and that they were not allowed to be there, and attacked.
